    characterDialogueBox: {fileID: 5392214278869696427, guid: e4955e0569eb60045a6cca06f2de1c00, type: 3}
  - line: ...I've been fighting for my life!
    characterDialogueBox: {fileID: 5392214278869696427, guid: e4955e0569eb60045a6cca06f2de1c00, type: 3}
  - line: ...........
    characterDialogueBox: {fileID: 7375646780646497706, guid: 37a5964f24b643d429c645e52473311f, type: 3}
  - line: YOU ALREADY FOUND IT!?!?!?
